WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.212
The block stages four inner positions per

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:05.923
pass in shared memory. The second pass

00:00:05.923 --> 00:00:07.860
covers positions four through seven.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.302
The inner dimension contains six

00:00:14.302 --> 00:00:16.245
positions, zero through five. Which

00:00:16.245 --> 00:00:18.964
positions in the second pass are outside

00:00:18.964 --> 00:00:19.741
the input?

00:00:28.241 --> 00:00:30.794
Positions six and seven load zero. Threads

00:00:30.794 --> 00:00:33.347
still reach the barriers that make the

00:00:33.347 --> 00:00:35.535
shared tiles ready and protect their

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:35.900
reuse.
